---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="PCLAF | Servicio técnico de PC y notebooks en Floresta" description="Servicio técnico de PC, notebooks y equipos Gamer en Floresta, Flores y CABA. Diagnóstico, reparación, upgrades y atención clara." canonical="/">
  <Navigation />
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="hero-grid"></div><div class="hero-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Taller abierto · Floresta, CABA</p><h1>Tu equipo<br /><span>vuelve a rendir.</span></h1><p class="hero-text">Servicio técnico de PC y notebooks con diagnóstico real, presupuesto claro y reparación profesional. También potenciamos tu setup Gamer.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/turnos.html">Reservar turno <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#servicios">Ver servicios <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-meta"><span><b>+10</b> años</span><span><b>4.9</b> Google</span><span><b>100%</b> diagnóstico previo</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual reveal-delay"><div class="scan-line"></div><img src="/images/pclaf-hardware.png" alt="Técnico de PCLAF reparando una placa madre" /><div class="visual-label"><span>01 / HARDWARE LAB</span><strong>PRECISIÓN<br />EN CADA COMPONENTE</strong></div><div class="visual-stamp">PC<br /><small>LAF</small></div></div></section>
    <section class="signal-bar"><span>DIAGNÓSTICO</span><span>NOTEBOOKS</span><span class="gamer-signal">GAMER</span><span>UPGRADES</span><span>WINDOWS</span><span>DATA</span></section>
    <section class="services section" id="servicios"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Qué resolvemos</p><h2>Menos vueltas.<br /><i>Más rendimiento.</i></h2></div><p>Te explicamos qué pasa, cuánto cuesta y qué alternativas tenés. Reparamos con criterio, no por descarte.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><a class="service-card service-main" href="/diagnostico-pc-notebook-floresta.html"><div class="card-top"><span>01</span><span>RECOMENDADO</span></div><div><h3>Diagnóstico<br /><i>y reparación</i></h3><p>Detectamos la falla, te mostramos el problema y te damos opciones reales.</p></div><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card gamer-card" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html"><span class="card-top">02 · GAMER</span><h3>Limpieza<br /><i>profunda</i></h3><p>Temperaturas bajo control. Más FPS. Más vida útil para tu setup.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/optimizacion-pc-lenta-floresta.html"><span class="card-top">03</span><h3>Upgrade<br /><i>inteligente</i></h3><p>Mejoramos lo que importa sin hacerte gastar en lo que no necesitás.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="manifesto"><div class="manifesto-line"></div><p class="eyebrow">Nuestra forma de trabajar</p><h2>La tecnología puede ser compleja.<br /><span>La atención no.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-bottom"><p>Presupuesto claro. Comunicación directa. Reparamos solo cuando das el ok.</p><a class="text-link" href="/precios.html">Ver precios orientativos <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="process section"><div class="process-title"><p class="eyebrow">El proceso</p><h2>Tres pasos.<br /><i>Cero vueltas.</i></h2></div><div class="process-list"><div class="process-item"><span>01</span><div><h3>Reservás</h3><p>Elegís un turno y nos contás qué está pasando.</p></div><strong>→</strong></div><div class="process-item"><span>02</span><div><h3>Diagnosticamos</h3><p>Revisamos tu equipo y te explicamos el hallazgo.</p></div><strong>→</strong></div><div class="process-item"><span>03</span><div><h3>Decidís</h3><p>Recibís un presupuesto claro y elegís cómo seguir.</p></div><strong>✓</strong></div></div></section>
    <section class="booking"><div><p class="eyebrow">Estamos para ayudarte</p><h2>¿Tu equipo<br /><i>te está frenando?</i></h2><p>Traelo al taller o escribinos. Encontramos la forma de que vuelva a acompañarte.</p><a class="btn btn-red" href="/turnos.html">Quiero reservar <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="booking-aside"><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>ATENCIÓN<br />PERSONALIZADA</strong><small>Campana 51 · Floresta</small></div></section>
  </main><footer><span>PCLAF / TECH SERVICE</span><span>Campana 51 · Floresta, CABA</span><a href="https://wa.me/5491135708345">WhatsApp ↗</a></footer>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
main{overflow:hidden}.hero,.section{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding-left:clamp(24px,6vw,80px);padding-right:clamp(24px,6vw,80px)}.hero{min-height:720px;padding-top:92px;padding-bottom:84px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .83fr;align-items:center;gap:8vw;position:relative}.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.5;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:90px 90px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 0%,transparent 74%);pointer-events:none}.eyebrow{font:500 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red)}.status-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;margin-right:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #e21b2322;animation:pulse 2s infinite}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,104px);line-height:.91;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:24px 0 28px;font-weight:700}.hero h1 span,h2 i{color:var(--red);font-style:normal}.hero-text{max-width:450px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin-top:35px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding:17px 19px;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid transparent;transition:transform .25s,background .25s,color .25s}.btn-red{background:var(--red);color:#fff}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);background:#fff;color:#080808}.btn span{font-size:19px}.text-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}.text-link span{color:var(--red);margin-left:9px}.hero-meta{display:flex;gap:25px;margin-top:55px;color:var(--muted);font:500 10px var(--mono);flex-wrap:wrap}.hero-meta b{color:var(--text);font-size:16px;margin-right:5px}.hero-visual{position:relative}.hero-visual img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.15);transition:filter .5s,transform .6s}.hero-visual:hover img{filter:grayscale(.35) contrast(1.1);transform:scale(1.025)}.scan-line{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--red);animation:scan 4s ease-in-out infinite}.visual-label{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.visual-label strong{font:700 16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.02em}.visual-stamp{position:absolute;right:-18px;top:28px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:16px;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:.78;transform:rotate(5deg)}.visual-stamp small{font-size:12px}.signal-bar{display:flex;gap:38px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:72px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;font:500 10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);animation:marquee 18s linear infinite}.gamer-signal{color:var(--green)}.section{padding-top:150px;padding-bottom:150px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:50px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:55px}.section-heading h2,.process h2,.manifesto h2,.booking h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,74px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:14px 0 0}.section-heading>p{max-width:330px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin:0}.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}.service-card{min-height:330px;background:var(--surface);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;text-decoration:none;transition:background .35s,transform .35s;position:relative}.service-card:hover{background:var(--surface-2);transform:translateY(-8px);z-index:2}.service-main{background:var(--red);color:#fff}.service-main:hover{background:#fff;color:#080808}.card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.service-card h3{font-size:34px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0}.service-card h3 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--red)}.service-main h3 i{color:#fff}.service-main:hover h3 i{color:var(--red)}.service-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:260px}.service-main p{color:#fff}.card-arrow{font-size:25px;align-self:end}.gamer-card:hover{background:var(--green);color:#080808}.gamer-card:hover h3 i,.gamer-card:hover p{color:#080808}.manifesto{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px 150px}.manifesto-line{width:100%;height:1px;background:var(--line);margin-bottom:70px}.manifesto h2 span{color:var(--red)}.manifesto-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-top:45px}.manifesto-bottom p{color:var(--muted);max-width:330px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:12vw;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.process-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.process-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr 30px;gap:22px;align-items:start;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.process-item>span,.process-item>strong{font:11px var(--mono);color:var(--red)}.process-item h3{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 7px}.process-item p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:14px}.booking{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto 80px;background:var(--surface);padding:75px clamp(24px,8vw,110px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:50px;align-items:end;border-top:3px solid var(--red)}.booking h2{margin-bottom:20px}.booking>div>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:390px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.booking-aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;font:11px var(--mono);text-align:right}.booking-aside small{color:var(--muted)}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px clamp(24px,6vw,80px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em}footer a{color:var(--red);text-decoration:none}@keyframes scan{0%,100%{top:10%}50%{top:88%}}@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.35);opacity:.55}}@keyframes marquee{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-4%)}}@media(max-width:800px){.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:55px;padding-top:70px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(56px,16vw,88px)}.hero-visual{width:82%;margin-left:auto}.section{padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:100px}.section-heading,.process,.booking,.manifesto-bottom{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service-card{min-height:270px}.booking{margin:0 18px 45px;padding:50px 28px}.booking-aside{text-align:left}.signal-bar{justify-content:flex-start}.visual-stamp{right:-10px}footer{flex-direction:column}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.signal-bar{animation:none}.scan-line,.status-dot{animation:none}.hero-visual img,.service-card,.btn{transition:none}}
</style>
